      "source": "class Card {\n    private final int padding;\n\n    public Card(int padding){\n        this.padding = padding;\n    }\n\n    @Override\n    public String toString(){\n        return \"Card(\"+padding+\")\";\n    }\n}\npublic class App {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        \n        System.out.println(\"[main]: lets begin!\");\n        \n        // Test your card padding\n        Card card = new Card(24);\n        System.out.println(card);\n    }\n}\n\n// v3 Explicitly call the main method\nApp.main(new String[0]);\n\n",
